# CCTV ANALYSIS SUMMARY — cam10, Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road
**Footage:** cam10.mp4, 60 minutes, 10:30–11:30 approx., 28-08-2025

---

## 1. SCENE
Camera cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a busy mixed-traffic junction. Footage covers daytime, beginning 10:30. Lighting is daylight throughout. Road surface turned damp from approximately minute 13 and again from minute 46, suggesting recent rain.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
- **Traffic:** Continuous heavy mixed traffic for the full hour. Dozens of cars per minute (predominantly white, plus silver, grey, black, red, maroon, and later pink and blue). Large numbers of helmeted motorcyclists/scooter riders (15–30 two-wheelers at any time in minutes 50–59, riders in light blue, green, white, red, pink/magenta, yellow, maroon and grey shirts). Many green-and-yellow auto-rickshaws (4–10+ per minute from minute 25; 6–10 at any time in minutes 50–59). Cyclists and pedestrians present throughout.
- **Goods/public transport vehicles:** ambulances, delivery vans, goods trucks, container trucks, a concrete mixer, a tipper, a tractor with tanker trailer (twice), buses (Tata, Eicher "NIRMA UNIVERSITY", "Where Practice Meets Theory" branded, red city bus), a JCB-type construction vehicle, a green-plate electric SUV, a green-plate Tata sedan, and a three-wheeler goods carrier.
- **People:** Pedestrians repeatedly crossed live lanes or walked between queued vehicles throughout, including a man with a backpack and a woman with children (min 0), a man with a shopping bag (min 12), two men on foot (min 16), a woman in a red dress (min 21), a woman in an orange/yellow sari standing in the carriageway (min 22), a blue-shirt man and white-shirt person (min 25), a woman in green interacting with vehicle occupants near an auto (min 29), a woman in pink on a scooter (min 30), a cyclist in yellow (min 38), helmetless riders (mins 37, 41), a man in dark t-shirt and shorts (min 46), three men walking between cars (min 49), a man in a light blue shirt between lanes (min 50), a man in a blue-and-white striped shirt and an older bald man in a pink shirt (min 56), a woman in a black top with maroon backpack (min 57), a woman in a red sari (min 58, ~20–50s), and a person with a white bag at the right kerb (min 59).

