## 6. CROWD AND CONGESTION
- Minutes 0–24: continuously heavy mixed traffic at the junction.
- Minutes 25–49: severe congestion, traffic near-gridlocked and crawling throughout; 4–10+ auto-rickshaws per minute; Nirma University bus stationary in the foreground mins 25–27.
- Minutes 50–55: heavily gridlocked.
